meta {
  name: 404
  seq: 3
}

script:pre-request {
  await bru.runRequest("Get Token");
}

docs {
  # 404 Not Found

  Covers every endpoint that takes an `applicationId` in the path. The folder's pre-request
  script (above) runs **Get Token** first to authenticate successfully, then each request
  targets a hardcoded, well-formed but non-existent `applicationId`
  (`ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff`) so the application lookup itself fails, asserting
  `404 Not Found`.
}
